      {
        "id": 17157,
        "title": "Console",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145149,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Linhas de código são <strong>instruções</strong> para um jogo seguir.</p><p>Quando executamos o código, estamos dizendo ao jogo para seguir as instruções que montamos.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145150,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A ordem das instruções é importante porque o jogo as segue linha por linha.</p><p>Crie <code>step1</code> primeiro, <code>step2</code> segundo, e <code>step3</code> terceiro.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Start game loop&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" step3 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Win level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const step1 = \"Spawn player\";</code> seguido de <code>const step2 = \"Start game loop\";</code> e finalmente <code>const step3 = \"Win level\";</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145151,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Com a instrução especial <code>console.log()</code>, nós dizemos ao computador para exibir um valor em uma área chamada <strong>console</strong>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game started!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"Game started!\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145152,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar a instrução <code>console.log()</code> quantas vezes quisermos. O computador exibe cada valor em uma linha no console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loading level...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;GO!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>(</code> seguido de <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145153,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar <code>console.log()</code> para exibir variáveis como <code>playerState</code> também.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerState = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerState);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>playerState</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145154,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando exibimos variáveis no console, os valores delas aparecem no lugar dos nomes. Se registrarmos <code>enemyName</code> aqui, o valor dele será exibido.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyName);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>enemyName</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145155,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como sabemos que <code>\"Game started!\"</code> é uma string?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Começa e termina com aspas duplas</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Contém letras e símbolos</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Começa e termina com aspas duplas.</p></body></html>"
          },
