            "id": 145159,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Coloque o código em ordem para exibir o valor <code>100</code> no console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const playerHealth = 100;</code> seguido de <code>console.log(playerHealth);</code>.</p></body></html>"
